    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted"><code>layout="stacked"</code> shows every culture at once, for side-by-side translation; <code>multiline</code> makes each a textarea. Each field carries its culture's <code>lang</code> and <code>dir</code>: Arabic is written right to left.</p>
    <div class="demo-stack">
      <pdx-localized-input label="Description" layout="stacked" multiline :cultures="cultures" :value="description"></pdx-localized-input>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>

